<p>Concentrate on maintaining a Crystalline Focus, increasing all your physical damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2.5%, 5.0%, 6.9%, 8.6%, 10%</acronym> and ignoring <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">14%, 29%, 37%, 42%, 46%</acronym> physical resistance of your targets.</p><p>Also raises your physical and magical saves by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 10, 15, 20, 25.</acronym></p>